    "final_answer": "I have found all the information needed. Here's the answer:\n\n## Answer\n\n### Universities offering Master of Advanced Study in Engineering on Coursera:\n**University of California, Berkeley (UC Berkeley College of Engineering)** — it appears to be the only university currently offering this specific degree (MAS-E) on Coursera.\n\n### Program Details:\n- **Degree**: Master of Advanced Study in Engineering (MAS-E)\n- **Institution**: UC Berkeley College of Engineering (ranked among the top 3 engineering schools in the U.S. by U.S. News & World Report)\n- **Format**: 100% online, part-time, self-paced\n- **Duration**: 24 months\n- **Total Courses**: 23 courses\n- **Total Cost**: $42,000 USD ($1,750 × 24 units, plus per-semester fees)\n- **Concentrations**: \n    1. AI/ML, Robotics, and Controls (AIRC)\n    2. Advanced Electronics Manufacturing & Materials (AEMM)\n    3. Energy, Infrastructure & the Environment (EIE)\n\n### Latest Application Deadline:\n**Summer 2027 Priority Application Deadline: January 8** (1月8日)\n\nThe page displays the priority application deadline for the Summer 2027 cohort as **January 8**. Students can either apply now or request more information via the \"立即申请\" (Apply Now) or \"索取信息\" (Request Information) buttons on the degree page.",
